Q. in ingress aws alb so target groups are service based ? in backend I hv payment service , wishlist service etc  ..for my e-commerce application
--> Yes, Target Groups are indeed service-based.
-------------------
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress
metadata:
  name: ecommerce-ingress
  annotations:
    alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/scheme: internet-facing
    alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/target-type: ip  # Highly recommended for EKS
spec:
  ingressClassName: alb
  rules:
  - http:
      paths:
      - path: /payment
        pathType: Prefix
        backend:
          service:
            name: payment-service    # Creates Target Group A
            port:
              number: 80
      - path: /wishlist
        pathType: Prefix
        backend:
          service:
            name: wishlist-service   # Creates Target Group B
            port:
              number: 80
